# Boot binaries must never be line-ending normalised. A normalised shimx64.efi or
# snponly.efi fails Secure Boot with no useful error at all — a miserable diagnosis.
# (USM handover, 2026-08-21.)
*.efi   binary
*.pxe   binary
*.kpxe  binary
*.wim   binary
*.sdi   binary
*.torrent binary
*.zip   binary
*.tar.gz binary
